            "review_title": "Review at Danang Souvenirs & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Patrick D\nWarsaw, Poland5461 contributions\n1\nDanang Souvenirs & Cafe 2\nNov 2018 • Solo\nA shop & cafe with a beautiful decoration that sells many unique souvenirs in Da Nang. Beauty products, bamboo and rattan bags, coffee, postcards, etc. A little more expensive than the market, but the quality is better. On the 1st floor cafe space with a small terrace, very good coffee and excellent pastries .. The staff is very friendly and smiling, good service. Nice place\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten July 4, 2019",
